<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`建表很简单，一张 user_info，主键 id 自增，username 唯一，password 和 save_time 都有默认值。用 PostgreSQL 演示。

然后是编译加启动。先把 POSTGRES 这个连接串环境变量设好，再把 CANGJIE_STDX_PATH 指到 stdx 的动态链接库目录，然后 ./boot.sh build 和 ./boot.sh run。

build 内部就是 fboot build ./fdemo 带上一串 orm 参数和 SM4 密钥；run 内部就是 fboot run ./fdemo 带上 --dylibPattern 那串正则。

预期屏幕上先出 fountain 的启动日志，然后是 fdemo 自己的 ASCII BANNER，最后一行是「fdemo(1.1.0) started by 1.3.x in 若干毫秒」。这一行里，应用名和版本号来自 fboot build 生成的版本模块，fountain 的版本来自框架，启动耗时是框架算的。

看到这一行就说明启动成功了。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 5 章 · 现场跑通 fdemo · 5.2 / 5.3</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>建表、编译、启动</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>PostgreSQL</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 272, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 10 }}>5.2 建表</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>CREATE TABLE public.user_info (</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'    id int8 GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY NOT NULL,'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'    username varchar(32) NOT NULL,'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'    "password" varchar(24) NOT NULL,'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>　　save_time timestamptz DEFAULT now() NULL,</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'    CONSTRAINT user_info_pkey PRIMARY KEY (id),'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'    CONSTRAINT user_info_username_key UNIQUE (username));'}</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 8 }}>5.3 编译 + 启动</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>export POSTGRES='postgres://user:pass@host:5432/dbname'</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>export CANGJIE_STDX_PATH=$CANGJIE_STDX_DYNAMIC_PATH</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>./boot.sh build　# 内部：fboot build ./fdemo --orm_drivers=postgres ...</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>./boot.sh run　　# 内部：fboot run ./fdemo --dylibPattern='(...)'</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#38BDF8', marginBottom: 8 }}>预期</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>
          <>[INFO-...] ...（fountain 启动日志）<br />　_____　.___<br />_/ ____\__| _/____　 _____　 ____<br />（fdemo 的 ASCII BANNER，来自 banner.txt）</>
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 'auto', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>fdemo(1.1.0) started by 1.3.x in xxxms</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>应用名 / 版本来自 fboot build 注入的版本模块。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #1E293B' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>fountain · 一站式服务器应用开发工具库</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>33 / 116</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
